{
 "description": "Create, read, request a revision, fund, or open a supplier checkout contract. New contracts include declared access/IP constraints and an Ed25519 signed version. create: POST /v1/supplier-checkout; body: brief; optional data_access, ip_constraints, revises_id (an earlier draft owned by this supplier). read: GET /v1/supplier-checkout/{token}. fund: POST /v1/supplier-checkout/{token}; body: amount_usd. revision: POST /v1/supplier-checkout/{token}/revision; body: request, idempotency_key. open: POST /v1/supplier-checkout/{token}/open.",
